+
+#### [EasyOCR](https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR)
+> **Description:** EasyOCR is a ready-to-use OCR library with support for 80+ languages and many common writing systems. Its value for insurance teams is speed of setup: it is easier to pilot than lower-level OCR stacks and works well for prototypes, internal tools, and lightweight extraction jobs. The README shows a simple API and broad language support, which is helpful for agencies handling multilingual applications or international documents. It is Apache-2.0 licensed and actively maintained. EasyOCR is not a full document platform, but it is a solid library when teams want fast text extraction without building much infrastructure first.
