+> The best AI tools for insurance agents in 2026 are not niche insurance-branded SaaS apps. They are open-source GitHub projects for document intake, OCR, PDF parsing, retrieval, voice transcription, and workflow automation that insurance agencies can self-host and adapt for quoting, underwriting support, claims intake, policy search, call notes, and compliance-heavy back-office work. This list only includes public GitHub repositories and avoids closed proprietary SaaS products.
