+- **Best for searchable policy and knowledge assistants:** [RAGFlow](https://github.com/infiniflow/ragflow), [AnythingLLM](https://github.com/Mintplex-Labs/anything-llm), [Haystack](https://github.com/deepset-ai/haystack), and [Qdrant](https://github.com/qdrant/qdrant)
+- **Best for call notes and voice workflows:** [whisper.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp), [faster-whisper](https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper), and [WhisperX](https://github.com/m-bain/whisperX)
+- **Best low-friction building blocks for custom insurance ops:** [LangChain](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain), [LlamaIndex](https://github.com/run-llama/llama_index), and [Flowise](https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise)
