+## Why This List
+Insurance agencies handle scanned ACORD forms, loss runs, declarations pages, policy packets, endorsements, email attachments, call recordings, and knowledge-heavy lookup work. That makes open-source AI unusually attractive for this market: agents need control over data handling, reproducible workflows, and tools they can adapt to their own carrier, MGA, claims, and servicing processes.
